<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - BZW cuts DSM EPS estimates.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - BZW cuts DSM EPS estimates.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Q3 results update.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p> DSM	     Chemicals     161.00  Barclays De Zoete Wedd</p>
<p>COMMENT: HOLD. 1996 and 1997 per share estimates cut after weaker than expected Q3 results. Any profit recovery short term in nature, capacity increases likely to erode industry margins in 1998. Continental European demand appears to be increasing, but pricing still a weak feature. Cost pressure unlikely to ease before Q1 1997 while margins further depressed by maintenance stops in Q4.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pr est  P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	29.70		 5.4     8.00</p>
<p>    1996		   25.50   28.10     6.3     9.00</p>
<p>    1997		   27.50   (N/A)     5.9    10.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
